{"id": "DfJhp9PRQLI", "title": "Video by vedic_twist", "description": "Vidur ki maut kyun nahi hui? Ek nazar, ek yog, aur Dharma wapas Dharma mein. Ep 03 ka ant. Agli kahani ke liye follow karo.\n\nMahabharat, Ashramavasika Parva, adhyay 26. Yuddh ke baad Dhritarashtra, Gandhari aur Kunti van chale gaye, aur Vidur bhi saath gaye. Wahan Vidur kathor tap mein sirf hawa par jee rahe the.\n\nYudhishthir milne aaye to Vidur ghane van mein bhaag gaye. Yudhishthir peechhe gaye. Ek ped se tike Vidur ne unki aankhon mein dekha, aur yog se apne praan Yudhishthir ke sharir mein mila diye.\n\nAakashvani hui: Vidur ka dah-sanskaar mat karo, wo swayam Dharma the. Ep 03 mein dekha tha ki Ani-Mandavya ke shraap se Yamraj, yaani Dharmraj, Vidur bane the. Aur Yudhishthir bhi Dharmraj ke putra the.\n\nAnkahi Kahaniyan, Episode 4. Ep 03 profile par hai.\n\n#mahabharata #vidur #yudhishthir #ankahikahaniyan", "channel": "vedic_twist", "uploader_id": "30248523911", "uploader": "Vedic twist | Mahabharata facts", "timestamp": 1793428585, "like_count": 11507, "comment_count": 39, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-896472556794765a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.174, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNlVOR8Lh6kGSIJqvJYuVcwm4KrfeCzxEXaKyxvptmX_IQ-VYr62gimkVV_7Au2HKIG4zGlt0C8kVw1tztp9qyh4pfiE6ZGAljSfbY.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdrWK31f0rcrEQjVJnfrNpBoOR5iTqtE42ATrC5jvDUcHESfswrkopHPzosiBjRlpz6rqrELZfV4zw_uZp_v4tg_&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=mFq3_mlfC5AQ7kNvwFiwKNl&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=9bx_-o7Vo_tVoLc2j7ZYTg